    "en": "Model copies",
    "ru": "Копии модели"
  },
  "description": "Written by akt-sim only: base, loud-first and no-twin copies; the simulator adds <thing>_<feature>_base features.",
  "version": {
    "model": "1.0.0"
  },
  "links": [
